          "value": "<p>@Template[type:emanation|distance:20]{20 feet} @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.v61oEQaDdcRpaZ9X]{Aura}</p><hr /><p>A buzzing static electricity surrounds the Mpeshi King. When a creature within the aura takes electricity damage, the damage arcs to the closest enemy of the mpeshi within the aura, dealing @Damage[1d6+2[sonic]] damage with no save. A creature can only receive arcing damage once from each attack or effect. Where two creatures are the same distance, the creature with more metal on their person is affected. Otherwise, determine targets randomly.</p>"
